			<div class="content" id="post-content-2397160">
									

<p>Meh. Decent concept but very boring and barebones execution. I'm all for cool ideas that aren't bogged down with extraneous test logs and interviews (like <a href="/scp-1489">SCP-1489</a> or <a href="/scp-1959">SCP-1959</a>, but for those types of skips the core idea has to be interesting enough to merit being on its own. In this case, the concept failed to retain my interest due to how plainly it was executed and presented. Downvoting.</p>

